!if 0
kbdmouse.dll (built as classpad_kbd.dll) - the ClassPad keyboard driver:
Layout Manager MDD (layoutmanager.lib) + the US input language + a PDD that
scans the SH7305 KEYSC matrix (kbd_pdd.cpp) and the device layouts that map
its scan codes to virtual keys (kbd_layout.cpp).
